{"unit_id":"tag:08M1:proof","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是终对象（final object）<MATH_0002>（属于 <MATH_0003>）的子层（subsheaf），并设 <MATH_0004> 是由那些 <MATH_0005> 组成的全子范畴（full subcategory），其中 <MATH_0006> 是同构（isomorphism）。由引理 <REF_0001>，函子（functor）<MATH_0007> 同构（isomorphic）于包含函子（inclusion functor）<MATH_0008>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n设 <MATH_0009> 是局部化（localization）函子（functor）（引理 <REF_0002>）。注意 <MATH_0010> 也可描述为由层（sheaves）<MATH_0011> 组成的集合，其中 <MATH_0012>。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n设 <MATH_0013> 是 <MATH_0014> 的两个态射（morphism）。为证明 <MATH_0015> 与余等化子（coequalizers）可交换（commutes），只须证明 <MATH_0016>、<MATH_0017> 在 <MATH_0018> 中的余等化子（coequalizer）属于 <MATH_0019>。这是显然的，因为两个态射（morphisms）<MATH_0020> 的余等化子（coequalizer）是 <MATH_0021>，且 <MATH_0022> 正合（exact）。推出（pushouts）的情形类似。\n\n<STRUCT_0005><STRUCT_0006>\n因此 <MATH_0023> 满足引理 <REF_0003> 的性质 (5)、(6)、(7)，从而态射（morphism）<MATH_0024> 满足该引理中提及的所有性质，特别是本引理提及的性质。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象"},{"source_term":"subsheaf","target_term":"子层"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"全子范畴"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"inclusion functor","target_term":"包含函子"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"coequalizers","target_term":"余等化子"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"可交换"},{"source_term":"coequalizer","target_term":"余等化子"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"coequalizer","target_term":"余等化子"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"pushouts","target_term":"推出"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"subsheaf","target_term":"子层","context":"待决